Ethernet  driver The driver provides access to a 10 Mb/s Ethernet
network through a card based on the SEEQ 8005  Advanced  Ethernet
Data  Link  Controller.   The  cards supported by this driver are
generally those supported by  the  driver  under  These  include:
Atomwide  A‐1005  Atomwide A‐1006 Atomwide A‐1007 Acorn Media se‐
lection on these cards is through links on the  board,  so  there
are  no  media  options available through the driver.  The driver
doesn’t support 8‐bit cards like the A‐1009, A‐1010,  A‐1011  and
A‐1012.
